Project Planning Phase – PocketSmart AI

The Project Planning Phase defines how the PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant project will be developed and completed. It includes deciding the project objectives, tasks, resources, timeline, and expected outcome.

1. Project Objectives

To develop a simple budget management system.

To help users track their income and expenses.

To monitor monthly budgets and spending.

To provide AI-based personalized recommendations.

To help users reduce unnecessary spending and increase savings.


2. Project Activities

1. Identify the problem and collect requirements.


2. Analyze user needs and define system requirements.


3. Design the system architecture and database.


4. Design the user interface.


5. Develop the frontend and backend.


6. Implement the budget and expense modules.


7. Integrate the recommendation/AI module.


8. Test the complete system.


9. Fix errors and improve performance.


10. Deploy and document the project.



3. Resources Required

Human Resources: Project team members, developer, tester.

Software: Programming tools, database, development environment, AI/recommendation tools.

Hardware: Computer/laptop and internet connection.


4. Project Timeline

Phase	Activity

Phase 1	Planning & Problem Identification
Phase 2	Requirement Analysis
Phase 3	System Design
Phase 4	Development
Phase 5	Testing
Phase 6	Deployment
Phase 7	Documentation & Presentation


5. Expected Outcome

The final PocketSmart AI system will provide users with an easy and intelligent way to track expenses, manage budgets, analyze spending, and receive personalized financial recommendations.
